  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>Zen 字體</strong></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">說明</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">這款清晰銳利的字體將進一步提升您的原始遊戲體驗。最初是為 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 模組包所設計，但現已開放給大眾使用！<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基於 Yoshimichi Ohira 所設計的 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Zen Dots\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zen Dots</a> Google 字體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">此字體採用 Open Font License 授權。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/631/zen-dots-font-character-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1150\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/584/163/2022-12-27_03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即獲取伺服器，與朋友一同玩樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>或下方橫幅，使用優惠碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享 25% 折扣！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
